# P5.2 residue: what the engine still draws in DCLF's shadow and reflection views, and the shapes DCLF does not claim. Whiterun,
# Dragonsreach and Riverwood at 13:00 with time stopped, then the race menu (the player's face shapes). Read in the log:
# - "[DCLF] census view <view>:" per 300 frames: the sun cascades, spot, point and focus shadow views should be absent or tiny;
#   "census view reflection faces" should name only "Sky: BSTriShape"; "lighting: unstable-buffer" and "lighting: eligible, no
#   record" are the unclaimed classes.
# - "[DCLF] shadow views: ... N not ready (...)": "raster-state=N" counts views left native for their rasterizer state.
# - "[DCLF] reflection faces (T4 ...): N updates, ... (K engine-only roots added under them)".
# - "[DCLF] unstable buffer: '<name>' ..." (first 16) and the coordinator line's "(unstable: M mappable, R refused, S no source)".
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_CENSUS=1
CS_DCLF_STATS=1
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;700:coc Whiterun;1700:dclf:shot=whiterun;1800:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;2700:dclf:shot=dragonsreach;2800:coc Riverwood;3800:dclf:shot=riverwood;3900:showracemenu;4400:dclf:shot=racemenu
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=4500
